    "title": "Edna showcases 2025 All-District football awards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Max Williams- ,\n1 days ago Edna football reveals 2025 All-District awards We highlight some of the top honors from Edna football this past season\nEDNA, Texas- This past season, the Edna Cowboys football team had an up-and-down year. The Cowboys started 1–3 after losing starting quarterback Trevor Floyd..\nBut once he returned, the Cowboys made a deep district run, including a 37–28 victory over Goliad. Their winning streak continued until they lost in the regional finals last week to the Llano Yellowjackets, 38–35.\nStill, congratulations on a 10–4 season for first-year head football coach Jamie Dixon and the team. Here is the full list of all-district awards for the Cowboys this year.\nSuperlatives\nDefensive MVP- Kenyon Turner\nCoach of the Year- Jamie Dixon\nDistrict MVP- Keegan Hicks\nFirst Team:\nDE, Phoenix Robertson\nS, Kyler Runnels\nOLB, Maurice Tilmon\nC, Mauro Murillo\nRB, Maverick Robertson\nOT, Micheal Martin\nDT, Marquise Tilmon\nOG, Thor Barton\nK, Jamie Gaytan- Hernandez\nWR, S, KR, Jayron Barnes\nWR, CB Jordon Bryant\nQB, Trevor Floyd\nOT, Cornell Norman\nSecond Team\nTE, Hunter Buehring\nCB, Jadale Barnes\nWR, Aidan Lugo\nOT, Micheal Martin\nDT, Mauro Murillo\nHonorable Mention\nRB, Zaevion Norman\nDL, JR Tello\nDL, Keegan Rodas\nOG, Joe Bustos\n2",
